(1 growing area has a stretch with no new sowing: PRIVATE {note}, east; $& \(all year\). A staple plot grows one crop across the whole) Tj
T* (block. Once its course for the year is used, no second staple may follow it. No declared winter cover reaches these months. A) Tj
T* (vegetable crop could cover them, but the planner will not put a vegetable on a traced field on its own - planted at full block width that) Tj
